<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Outpost | Make room for outside</title><meta name="description" content="Explore a HyperChi and Alpine.js marketing page with a live JSON trip finder."><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/marketing.css"><script defer src="/static/js/outpost.js"></script><script defer src="/static/js/alpine.min.js"></script></head>
<body class="outpost" id="top"><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="example-bar"><a href="/docs/integrations">← HyperChi examples</a><span>Alpine.js + JSON</span><a href="/docs/alpine">How this works ↗</a></div><header class="marketing-nav wrap"><a class="wordmark" href="#top">OUTPOST /</a><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#idea">The idea</a><a href="#trips">Find your trip</a><a href="#questions">Good to know</a></nav></header>
<main id="main"><section class="outpost-hero"><img src="/static/img/examples/mountain.webp" width="1800" height="1200" alt="A forested mountain valley beneath snowy peaks and a blue sky" fetchpriority="high"><div class="wrap"><p class="label">Small groups. Wide open spaces.</p><h1>Make room<br>for outside.</h1><p>Unhurried adventures for people who would rather collect memories than miles.</p><a class="button" href="#trips">Find your kind of outside ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="wrap outpost-intro" id="idea"><p class="label">Leave the busy behind</p><h2>Less itinerary.<br>More possibility.</h2><p class="large-copy">A path worth following. A meal worth slowing down for. A few people you are glad you met.</p><p>Outpost is a fictional outdoor club built around a simple idea: getting outside should feel like a beginning, not another thing to organize.</p></section>
<section class="wrap outpost-values"><h2>A different pace.</h2><dl><div><dt>Walk together</dt><dd>Small groups leave room for conversation, quiet, and the occasional change of plan.</dd></div><div><dt>Travel thoughtfully</dt><dd>Stay on the trail, leave places as you found them, and support the people who call them home.</dd></div><div><dt>Arrive curious</dt><dd>You do not need to be the fastest. Just bring a little preparation and an open mind.</dd></div></dl></section>
<section class="wrap trips-section" id="trips" x-data="tripFinder"><p class="label">Your next few days, a little different</p><h2>Where will you<br>find your feet?</h2><p>Browse illustrative trips by landscape. Sample prices are per person; these trips cannot be booked.</p><form @submit.prevent="load"><label for="terrain">Choose your landscape</label><div class="finder-controls"><select id="terrain" name="terrain" x-model="terrain"><option value="all">Every landscape</option><option value="mountain">Mountain</option><option value="coast">Coast</option><option value="forest">Forest</option></select><button type="submit" class="button" :disabled="loading">Find trips ↗</button></div></form><noscript><p>The full collection is shown below. Enable JavaScript to filter it.</p></noscript><p x-cloak x-show="loading" role="status">Finding your next adventure…</p><div x-cloak x-show="error" role="alert"><p x-text="error"></p><button type="button" class="text-link" @click="load">Try again</button></div><p x-cloak x-show="loaded && !loading && !error" aria-live="polite" x-text="summary"></p>
<div class="trip-grid" x-show="!loaded">{{range .Result}}<article class="trip"><p class="terrain">{{.Terrain}} · {{.Days}} days</p><h3>{{.Name}}</h3><p>{{.Description}}</p><p class="trip-price">${{.Price}} <small>/ person</small></p><a href="#packing">What to bring ↗</a></article>{{end}}</div>
<div class="trip-grid" x-cloak x-show="loaded" :aria-busy="loading"><template x-for="trip in trips" :key="trip.name"><article class="trip"><p class="terrain" x-text="trip.terrain + ' · ' + trip.days + ' days'"></p><h3 x-text="trip.name"></h3><p x-text="trip.description"></p><p class="trip-price"><span x-text="'$' + trip.price"></span> <small>/ person</small></p><a href="#packing">What to bring ↗</a></article></template></div><p x-cloak x-show="loaded && trips.length === 0 && !loading && !error">No trips for this landscape yet. Try another landscape.</p></section>
<section class="wrap packing-section" id="packing"><div><h2>Pack light.<br>Come prepared.</h2><p>This example collection is a starting point for imagining a trip, not route-specific outdoor guidance.</p></div><ul><li>Comfortable walking shoes and weather-appropriate layers</li><li>A day pack, water, and something to eat along the way</li><li>Personal essentials and any medication you need</li><li>Time to read the route and conditions before setting out</li></ul></section>
<section class="wrap outpost-note"><p class="large-copy">The best part might be the view.<br>It might also be the way there.</p><a class="text-link" href="#idea">Our way of getting outside ↗</a></section>
<section class="wrap faq-section" id="questions"><h2>A little trail knowledge.</h2><details><summary>Do I need hiking experience?</summary><p>Our fictional collection spans gentle woodland walks and longer mountain traverses. A real provider would explain fitness requirements and equipment for each route.</p></details><details><summary>Are these departures available?</summary><p>No. All trips and prices are demonstration data. The finder makes a real JSON request, but no availability service is connected.</p></details><details><summary>Is my search stored?</summary><p>No personal information is requested or saved by this example. Your selected landscape is sent as a query parameter.</p></details></section></main><footer class="wrap marketing-footer"><a class="wordmark" href="#top">OUTPOST /</a><p>A fictional outdoor club. Built to explore.</p><a href="/docs/alpine">Read the integration guide ↗</a></footer></body></html>
